/-! ###### polytope cells for Q = 7: the instance layer (bridge-port, generated by amg/genpcell2.py)

Kernel functions unrolled on the curried state (14 gap and 42 pair bounds); every proof is a link to the generic
layer `AMW.PCellGen` through `toCl : St → Cl`.  Engine, tables and per-term minorants: mvt-engine's MinCore on the AM
engine (pyramid oracle adapted from five-point-pyramid-2 by typh, convex basins after six-point-convex-basins-2 by typh,
Apache-2.0). ###### -/

set_option maxRecDepth 100000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

noncomputable section

namespace AMW.Cert.PCellV8N2

open AMW.Cert AMW.Cert.Pyr AMW.Cert.PyrD AMW.Cert.PCell

def cN : ℕ := 557992
/-- the multiplier quantum: `Y = SIG · Yq`, `Yq < 2^12` (`2^-14` per unit g) -/
